        <segment id="1" parent="8" relname="span">Good post.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="elaboration">I would have to agree that the nature of intuitiveness is subjective.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="8" relname="elaboration">The questions that Jared Spool raises are essential.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="9" relname="span">This also connects well to what we have discussed in previous threads</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="elaboration">-- the notion in the Marcus article that we need to ask "who are our users?"</segment>
